te MP3/WAV copy.\n- Analyze automatically selects Group 1; switching groups keeps your choice for the same timing list.\n- Audio sits after Assets, with theme-matched sliders.\n- Updates opens centered over HUB on its current monitor.\n\nBeta only: open Updates, choose Beta, then Check now. Download update, then Install & restart when ready. This beta does not trigger the blue Stable update notification.\n\nUsers on older legacy Test builds should update to Stable 3.0.3 first, then check Beta. Existing Stable 3.0.3 and Beta-capable builds can update directly. Installing remains optional; Stable is unchanged.\n\nAudio matching exports a new copy and preserves timing. Review the result in your game before replacing assets.\n","package":{"name":"HUB-3.0.4-beta.2-update.zip","sha256":"8f1ff8c7576e8a88a83520ddd9693560b979e835d9f5d5ea4fe7ee89429bf282","size":80279112},"platform":"windows-x64","repository":"midas-soft/sigma-helper-hub","schema":1,"tag":"v3.0.4-beta.2","version":"3.0.4-beta.2"},"signature":"6DOYIVxbaCAq3shzRigCEL7TOr3DbJVj4oEgF/nKVrkt5CDU/voZn0b5cAS9EIF5jki1Qb486MNql/GzKlsBBw=="}